soak-test-watchdog: the counter runs at 23999881 Hz, measured against this kernel's timer. The JH7110 keeps no record this kernel knows of how its previous boot ended, so a watchdog reset shows only as this kernel starting again.
soak-test-watchdog: ARMED. THIS BUILD RESETS THE MACHINE IF THE SOAK STOPS BEATING: 720000000 ticks of the 24000000 Hz core clock counted twice, so a reset 60.0s after the last pet, which comes every 5s from the beat.
soak-test-watchdog: a soak that FAILS prints its verdict and dump and then stops petting, so the reset follows the evidence and never replaces it. To stop the watchdog: press any key on this console. It is halted at the next beat and the soak keeps running.
